$P SUITE-GEOM-CYLISIZE-RESTORE-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-CYLI-1
Q REF
Q NAME
Q DIAM
DIAM 1500
Q DIAM
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite geom/cyli_size restore: CYLI-1 DIAM 1500'
